{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20777","headline":"常州孟谏议座上闻韩员外职方贬国子博士有感五首 五 · 卢仝","name":"常州孟谏议座上闻韩员外职方贬国子博士有感五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁怜野田子，海内一韩侯。\n左道官虽乐，刚肠得健无。\n功名生地狱，礼教死天囚。\n莫言耕种好，须避蒺藜秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20777.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20777","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}